John 19:1 , Christ is scourged, crowned with thorns, and beaten;
John 19:4 , Pilate is desirous to release him, but being overcome with the outrage of the Jews, he delivers him to be crucified;
John 19:23 , They cast lots for his garments;
John 19:25 , He commends his mother to John;
John 19:28 , He dies;
John 19:31 , His side is pierced;
John 19:38 , He is buried by Joseph and Nicodemus.
